import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 477 | Infinite Terror · Quest Sediment Domain Review: Team Collapse After Zheng Zha's Absence","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 477 | Infinite Terror · Quest Sediment Domain Review: Team Collapse After Zheng Zha's Absence","no":477,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Infinite Terror","Quest Sediment Domain","Zheng Zha","Team Collapse"],"related":["29-Symbiotic-Degree Assessment System","25-Symbiotic Feedback Loop Mechanism","17-Plane-Transcendent Strongest Standard"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0477_模块2-无限恐怖-求索域复盘-郑吒缺位后的团队崩溃.md","filePath":"en/0477_模块2-无限恐怖-求索域复盘-郑吒缺位后的团队崩溃.md"}`),s={name:"en/0477_模块2-无限恐怖-求索域复盘-郑吒缺位后的团队崩溃.md"};function o(r,e,l,h,d,c){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-477-infinite-terror-·-quest-sediment-domain-review-team-collapse-after-zheng-zha-s-absence" tabindex="-1">Entry 477 | Infinite Terror · Quest Sediment Domain Review: Team Collapse After Zheng Zha&#39;s Absence <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-477-infinite-terror-·-quest-sediment-domain-review-team-collapse-after-zheng-zha-s-absence" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 477 | Infinite Terror · Quest Sediment Domain Review: Team Collapse After Zheng Zha&#39;s Absence&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Infinite Terror Decomposition (Entry 10) | Benchmark base: Documents 29, 25, 17</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-take-zheng-zha-off-the-chessboard" tabindex="-1">Introduction: take Zheng Zha off the chessboard <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-take-zheng-zha-off-the-chessboard" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: take Zheng Zha off the chessboard&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou (Myriad-Spirits Balanced-Anchor Origin Universe)&#39;s six top-level axioms — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, <strong>law-first axiom</strong>, universal equal infinite law as core — requires every benchmarked system to do &quot;Quest Sediment Domain simulation review.&quot; The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. This entry uses a cruelest thought experiment to test China Team: <strong>take Zheng Zha out of the team, what is left?</strong></p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Quest Sediment Domain fully replicates China Team. At the 30th instance node, variable injected: Zheng Zha &quot;withdraws due to injury&quot; before instance starts, does not participate in this battle. Observation results:</p><ul><li>Instance advancement speed drops 73%</li><li>Team decision time from average 40 seconds extends to average 11 minutes (no one dares decide)</li><li>First occurrence of &quot;member擅自 abandoning mission to self-preserve&quot;</li><li>At instance end battle-loss rate from normal 8% rises to 41%</li></ul><p>Conclusion: Zheng Zha alone contributes China Team&#39;s about 70% combat strength and 90% decision-making power. He is not &quot;captain&quot;; he is &quot;the team&#39;s operating system.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This data itself is the answer. A team&#39;s combat strength and decision-making power 90% concentrated on one person means:</p><ul><li>This person alive, team can fight</li><li>This person wounded, team paralyzed</li><li>This person dead, team disintegrates</li></ul><p>This is not a team; this is <strong>one person wearing seven people&#39;s shells.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Zheng Zha himself is not wrong. But his centralization made other members lose the opportunity to &quot;become themselves.&quot; When Zhao Kongkong, Luo Gandao, Zero Point get used to &quot;waiting for captain&#39;s order,&quot; they can never grow their own judgment muscles. <strong>Predatory thinking&#39;s most hidden cost is making the protected lose growth ability.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Zheng Zha Present</th><th>Zheng Zha Absent</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Team can fight</td><td>Team paralyzed</td><td>Team runs as usual</td></tr><tr><td>Decision 40 seconds</td><td>Decision 11 minutes</td><td>Council tiered decisions</td></tr><tr><td>Battle loss 8%</td><td>Battle loss 41%</td><td>Battle loss ≤ 5%</td></tr><tr><td>Single-point dependence</td><td>Single-point collapse</td><td>Distributed redundancy</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan-this-entry-s-core" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan (This Entry&#39;s Core) <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan-this-entry-s-core" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan (This Entry&#39;s Core)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Review conclusions:</p><ol><li><strong>Single-point dependence index</strong>: Zheng Zha&#39;s contribution share to China Team ≈ 90%, belongs to &quot;extremely high single-point dependence.&quot;</li><li><strong>Collapse threshold</strong>: Zheng Zha absent more than one instance, team undergoes &quot;decision paralysis — self-preservation split — battle-loss surge&quot; three-stage collapse.</li><li><strong>Institutional substitution benefit</strong>: after injecting Anchor-Symbiosis institutions (council + multi-point cultivation + Alaya knowledge filing), Zheng Zha-absent battle-loss rate from 41% drops to 6%, decision time stable within 90 seconds.</li><li><strong>Civilizational revelation</strong>: any system equating &quot;captain&quot; with &quot;team&quot; is betting civilization on a single log.</li></ol><p>The review also reveals a deeper mechanism: when Zheng Zha is present, China Team looks united; actually it is &quot;united by captain&#39;s will.&quot; Once captain is absent, long-suppressed contradictions between members (Zhao Kongkong vs. Luo Gandao tactical differences, Zero Point vs. Qi Tengyi style conflicts) all erupt. This shows China Team&#39;s unity is not institutional unity, but personality unity — <strong>a team sustained by one person&#39;s charisma; once the personality disperses, the team disperses.</strong> What Anchor-Symbiosis institutions solve is precisely this &quot;personality unity&quot; unreliability: build unity on commonly followed rules, not on trust in a specific person.</p><p>Quest Sediment Domain also did a control experiment: let China Team start &quot;institutional training&quot; while Zheng Zha is present — after every instance forced to write review, forced to cultivate deputies, forced to publicize decision process. Thirty years later, China Team in an instance where Zheng Zha was absent, battle-loss rate only from normal 8% rises to 15%, far below &quot;no institutional training&quot;&#39;s 41%. This control shows: single-point dependence is not unchangeable; it was just never seriously trained. <strong>As long as from the start we take &quot;do not depend on captain&quot; as training goal, the team can grow distributed redundancy.</strong> Zheng Zha&#39;s tragedy is not that he is too strong, but that he was never required to &quot;not be strong.&quot;</p><p>This control experiment&#39;s revelation is far-reaching: single-point dependence is not innate, it is trained. As long as from the start we take &quot;distributed&quot; as training goal, any team can grow redundant ability not depending on one person. Zheng Zha and China Team just lacked this training — and this training is precisely what Anchor-Symbiosis institutions provide.</p><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. &quot;Zheng Zha can always step up&quot; itself is a plot-level setting; not reproducible</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: high</strong>. Original mid-late period repeatedly has Zheng Zha &quot;fall then stand up,&quot; masking the team&#39;s true structure</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: extremely high</strong> (by five-level standard, Zheng Zha approaches Gu Chensha / single-log style; difference only in he brought a group of teammates)</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: 70% combat strength concentrated on one person; structural waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: teammates&#39; judgment muscles stripped by captain</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s students at least independent; Zheng Zha&#39;s teammates not independent</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: other teams outside China Team are cannon-fodder backdrop in original</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: team abilities cannot be distributively replicated</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Take Zheng Zha away, China Team disperses. This is not Zheng Zha&#39;s failure; this is &quot;captain-centralization&quot; structure&#39;s failure. What Heng Yuan Zhou wants is not &quot;a more formidable captain,&quot; but <strong>a team that can fight without a captain</strong> — because as long as there is still one person who must carry everyone, everyone&#39;s tomorrow hangs on that one person&#39;s heartbeat.</p><p>In the final analysis, Infinite Terror · Quest Sediment Domain review · team collapse after Zheng Zha&#39;s absence described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./468_模块2-无限恐怖-总论郑吒与轮回收割体系定性.html">Entry 468 · Overview</a> · <a href="./471_模块2-无限恐怖-郑吒掠夺思维拆解-团队资源的个人中心化.html">Entry 471 · Zheng Zha&#39;s Predatory Thinking</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/29-共生度评估体系.html">29-Symbiotic-Degree Assessment System</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const g=t(s,[["render",o]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
